// Article 1. Regular schedule: whose week it is, and where Mia is.
Fact parent Identified by Rosa, Daniel
Placeholder other For parent
Param start : Time = 0
Var with Identified by parent = Rosa

Bool rosa-week
  Holds when (Current Time - start) % 14 < 7
Bool handover-day
  Holds when (Current Time - start) % 7 < 1
Duty regular-week Holder parent Claimant other
  Holds when rosa-week && parent == Daniel && other == Rosa
           , !rosa-week && parent == Rosa && other == Daniel
  Violated when with(parent) && !handover-day
Act hand-over Actor parent Recipient other
  Holds when with(parent)
  Creates with(other)

Clause 1.1 Definition => parent, start, rosa-week, with
Clause 1.2 => handover-day, regular-week, hand-over.
